      "writtenOn": "2023-10-23T06:54:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What is \"extended\" about this address? If it\u0027s just an EUI-64 address, then it should be called that, not MacAddress. (On Android, the MacAddress class only supports 48-bit addresses.)",
