      "writtenOn": "2023-10-23T06:54:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If this MAC address constitutes a persistent identifier of the device, ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE is not appropriate. For reference, the wifi MAC address is protected by LOCAL_MAC_ADDRESS.",
