      "message": "Generally it\u0027s not good practice to have synchronous accessors that take or return Network objects. This information can really only be correctly determined from the ConnectivityManager callback thread. So this probably shouldn\u0027t be here. Instead I think we need a TransportInfo object on Thread networks that contains the controller ID.",
